{"product_id":"the-messengers","title":"The Messengers","description":"\u003cp\u003e\"Perhaps we're here to save a few people. Maybe that's the gift.\"When fifteen-year-old Frances is sent down to the coast to Helmstown, to live with her aunt, uncle and cousin, she meets and befriends Peter Kennedy, a somewhat tramp-like character who lives in a beach hut along the seafront. As soon as they meet, Peter recognizes that Frances is a messenger, just like him. As messengers, they experience black-outs, and when they come round, they have the ability to draw, in minute detail, the scene of an accident. Although Frances can’t change the past, she realises that she can change the future, at least for a chosen few.Another compelling and thrilling novel for teenagers by the author of the highly acclaimed Daylight Saving.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 129 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Edward Hogan\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781406337181\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 224\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45807538765977,"sku":"17RB-29781406337181","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68f6094a9b022_The_Messengers_Edward_Hogan.jpg?v=1760972108","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-messengers","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}